					39 00 00 40 00 00 04 84 11 17 07
					39 00 00 40 00 00 04 85 09 0F 04
					39 00 00 40 00 00 04 86 15 1F F8
					39 00 00 40 00 00 04 87 13 1C FA
					39 00 00 40 00 00 04 88 0E 15 FC
					39 00 00 40 00 00 04 89 03 05 FF
					39 00 00 40 00 00 04 8A 14 1E 05
					39 00 00 40 00 00 04 8B 13 1B 04
					39 00 00 40 00 00 04 8C 11 16 03
					39 00 00 40 00 00 04 8D 06 0D 04
					39 00 00 40 00 00 04 8E 01 01 0E
					39 00 00 40 00 00 04 8F 12 1D 07
					39 00 00 40 00 00 04 FF 5A A5 5C
					39 00 00 40 00 00 04 C8 04 07 02
					39 00 00 00 00 00 04 FF 5A A5 00

					// LVD ON
					39 00 00 40 00 00 04 FF 5A A5 05
					39 00 00 40 00 00 02 83 03
					39 00 00 40 00 00 02 84 03
					39 00 00 40 00 00 02 AA 94
					39 00 00 40 00 00 02 AB C9
					39 00 00 40 00 00 02 AC 05
					39 00 00 40 00 00 04 FF 5A A5 08
					39 00 00 40 00 00 02 B0 55
					39 00 00 40 00 00 04 FF 5A A5 1C
					39 00 00 40 00 00 03 FD 00 94
					39 00 00 40 00 00 02 E1 A2
